#  h264p's ipm family: its context indices and its tunable parameters.
#  IDX/IDX-FORMAT.md is the format; ../mk.sh regenerates MOD/ipm_h.inc and
#  MOD/ipm_p.inc from this file and ipm.inc.
#
#  Intra prediction modes: the actual Intra4x4/8x8 mode as a binary tree (nodes
#  1-15), intra_chroma_pred_mode in truncated unary (nodes 16-18). k8 is 0
#  for 4x4, 1 for 8x8 blocks, 2 for chroma; ma/mb the modes of the blocks A
#  and B (9 for DC by rule, 10 none) -- for chroma the modes of the
#  macroblocks A and B (4 none) --, mp the most probable mode, blk the
#  block, pv the previous block's mode (9 none), col the same block in the
#  previous picture of the type (9 none); dm the strongest edge direction
#  next to the macroblock at the block's place (DIMD, 9 none) and ds the
#  strength of the edges (0 none); pm the mode that predicts the block best
#  in the proxy (9 none), mg how much worse the most probable mode does there
#  (1 + tc_qlog of halves of x264's lambda), pr the best mode but the most
#  probable one as a remainder (8 none) and rg how much better than the
#  next it does, dr DIMD's mode as a remainder, pq how well the proxy
#  matched, mh the last most-probable-mode flags of the macroblock, mc the
#  mode of the block above right.

Prefix H_ipm
Debug 1
Const 0

Index a
 a_k8: k8, 1!11
 a_ma: ma, 1!1111111111
 a_mb: mb, 1!1111111111
 a_mc: mc, 1!1111111111

Index b
 b_k8: k8, 1!00
 b_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 b_pv: pv, 1!111111111
 b_mh: mh, 1!1111111111111111

Index c
 c_k8: k8, 1!11
 c_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 c_col: col, 1!111111111

Index d
 d_k8: k8, 1!11
 d_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 d_dm: dm, 1!111111111
 d_ds: ds, 1!000010010

Index e
 e_k8: k8, 1!11
 e_pm: pm, 1!111111111
 e_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 e_mg: mg, 1!111111111111

Index h
 h_k8: k8, 1!11
 h_pr: pr, 1!11111111
 h_dr: dr, 1!00000000
 h_ds: ds, 1!111111111
 h_rg: rg, 1!111111111111

Index i
 i_k8: k8, 1!00
 i_pm: pm, 1!111111111
 i_dm: dm, 1!110000001
 i_ma: ma, 1!1111111111

Index j
 j_k8: k8, 1!11
 j_mh: mh, 1!1111111111111111
 j_pr: pr, 1!11111111
 j_mb: mb, 1!1111111111

Index k
 k_k8: k8, 1!11
 k_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 k_pm: pm, 1!111100100
 k_pv: pv, 1!111111111

Index l
 l_k8: k8, 1!11
 l_mc: mc, 1!1111111111
 l_ma: ma, 1!1111111111
 l_dm: dm, 1!101101111

Index s
 s_k8: k8, 1!11
 s_pr: pr, 1!11111111
 s_pq: pq, 1!111111111111
 s_mg: mg, 1!000100100000

Index f
 f_k8: k8, 1!00
 f_dr: dr, 1!11111111

Index m
 m_k8: k8, 1!00
 m_ma: ma, 1!0000000000
 m_mb: mb, 1!0000000000
 m_mg: mg, 1!111111111111

Index w
 w_k8: k8, 1!11
 w_mp: mp, 1!111111111
 w_dm: dm, 1!100000000
 w_ds: ds, 1!111111111

Index t
 t_k8: k8, 1!0

Index n
 n_k8: k8, 1!0

Index g
 g_k8: k8, 1!0

Number rA, 1, 0!11100100
Number rB, 1, 0!00010001
Number rC, 1, 0!00000000
Number rE, 1, 0!01000000
Number rH, 1, 0!11000101
Number rI, 1, 0!01000000
Number rJ, 1, 0!01000000
Number rK, 1, 0!11011100
Number rL, 1, 0!01000000
Number rD, 1, 0!11111111
Number rT, 1, 0!00110111
Number rG, 1, 0!01011010
Number rS1, 1, 0!00110
Number rS2, 1, 0!00110
Number lr, 1, 0!01100
Number lrm, 1, 0!01100
Number mbm, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwA, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwB, 1, 0!00001010
Number mwC, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwE, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwH, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwI, 1, 0!00010110
Number mwJ, 1, 0!00100000
Number mwK, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwL, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwD, 1, 0!11100000
Number mwT, 1, 0!00000000
Number mwG, 1, 0!00000000
Number bw, 1, 0!01000
Number mt, 1, 0!110
Number qs, 1, 3!0100001
Number qf, 1, 3!0010000
Number mb, 1, 0!00101100

#  Rows per table, as log2: a table whose index Volume fits in 2^h rows is
#  direct, one that does not is hashed into 2^h rows and contexts share
#  them.  31 is "never hashed".  Frozen: left live these only grow.
! Number hA, 1, 0!11000
! Number hB, 1, 0!11000
! Number hE, 1, 0!11000
! Number hH, 1, 0!11000
! Number hI, 1, 0!11000
! Number hJ, 1, 0!11000
! Number hK, 1, 0!11000
! Number hL, 1, 0!11000
! Number hD, 1, 0!11000
! Number hS, 1, 0!11000
! Number hF, 1, 0!11000
! Number hM, 1, 0!11000
! Number hT, 1, 0!11000
! Number hN, 1, 0!11000
